tartedAt_source\": started_src, \"producedAt_source\": produced_src}}\n```\n\nAlso need `source`/`line_with` available — they are module-level in emit_custody.py. Note `source(job, log, ...)` with log a Path → rel_path resolves to job-relative.\n\n(10) evaluator_history: add generation refusal loop after annotate.\n\nBase:\n```\n    annotate(calls, who, (e.get(\"model\") or {}).get(\"identifier\"), ref, pin)\n    check_pin_order(pin, calls, who, ref)\n```\nInsert between:\n```\n    for c in calls:\n        if c.host in H.AGGREGATORS and c.generation_absent:\n            ref.add(\"generation\", f\"{who}: {c.label} went through {c.host} and its /api/v1/generation reply is \"\n                                  f\"null, so no reply evidences which provider answered; no endpoint is written \"\n                                  f\"from the pin or the routing config (bar N4)\")\n```\nAlso in maker_history similarly (before check_pin_order) so the refusal is in emit_custody.py too.\n\nAlso, evaluator_history's endpoint: `first.endpoint` — with generation_absent, endpoint_of returns None, so no pin fallback.\n\n(11) also the maker model block endpoint: `mk[\"endpoint\"]` is None when refused. Fine.\n\nNow the harness log bundling in tools/pack_stranger_bundle.py.\n\nAdd after evidence collection:\n```\n    for c in pred.get(\"checks\") or []:\n        ...\n```\nImplement:\n```\n    time_files = set()\n    for s in ((pred.get(\"x-plumbline\") or {}).get(\"time_sources\") or {}).values():\n        if isinstance(s, dict) and s.get(\"file\"):\n            time_files.add(s[\"file\"])\n    for s in ((pred.get(\"maker\") or {}).get(\"x-plumbline\") or {}).get(\"harness_log\"), :\n```\nSimpler:\n```\n    logs = set()\n    for s in ((pred.get(\"x-plumbline\") or {}).get(\"time_sources\") or {}).values():\n        if isinstance(s, dict) and s.get(\"file\"):\n            logs.add(s[\"file\"])\n    for seat in [pred.get(\"maker\") or {}, *(pred.get(\"evaluators\") or [])]:\n        hl =