e can move `xp = pred.get(\"x-plumbline\") or {}` up before events. But need avoid duplicate. We can define early after pred. Then use later. Current code has `xp = pred.get(\"x-plumbline\") or {}` before ctx. We can move it up to just after `pred = record[\"predicate\"]`. Then remove later duplicate. But patch minimal: define `xp = pred.get(\"x-plumbline\") or {}` right after pred, and delete the later line. We'll do.\n\nThen add:\n```\n    # the live event ledger\n    ev_log = (xp.get(\"events_log\") or {}).get(\"name\") or \"inputs/custody-events.jsonl\"\n    if (job / ev_log).is_file():\n        add(ev_log, job / ev_log)\n    else:\n        missing.append(f\"{ev_log} (the custody event ledger)\")\n    # harness logs the record's times or endpoints came from\n    harness = set()\n    for holder in [pred.get(\"maker\") or {}] + (pred.get(\"evaluators\") or []):\n        hx = holder.get(\"x-plumbline\") or {}\n        if hx.get(\"harness_log\"):\n            harness.add(hx[\"harness_log\"])\n    for name in sorted(harness):\n        src = None\n        for base in (ev_dir, job):\n            p = base / name\n            if p.is_file():\n                src = p; break\n        if src:\n            add(f\"evidence/{name}\", src)\n        else:\n            missing.append(f\"evidence/{name} <- harness log {name}\")\n```\nBut if harness log already added via `ev_names` as `evidence/<name>`, `add` will overwrite same bytes. Fine.\nNeed ensure `ev_log` path may be relative to job. `xp[\"events_log\"][\"name\"]` is \"inputs/custody-events.jsonl\". Good.\nWhat if no events log? The task says bundle must carry it. If missing, packer should refuse? N7 requires. We can add missing. But existing job-rejected may not have events log? The base fixture might. If not, packer would refuse, breaking tests? The task says fixtures have `inputs/custody-events.jsonl`. The held-out do. Existing job-rejected maybe also. The base emitter reads events log optional. The base packer didn't re