wered)\")\n        return None, route\n```\nAnd before route:\n```\n        return c.host, {\"endpoint_basis\": \"request URL host\", \"request_host\": c.host}\n    route = {\"aggregator\": c.host, \"upstream_provider\": c.provider}\n```\n✓.\n\nread_log in custody_history:\n```\n    calls = [Call(path.name, i, it) for i, it in enumerate(items) if isinstance(it, dict) and \"request\" in it]\n    if not calls:\n        ref.add(\"harness-log\", f\"{who}: {path.name} records no call (no object with a `request`)\")\n    for c in calls:\n        if c.at is None:\n            ref.add(\"time\", f\"{who}: {c.label} carries neither a response Date header nor a `created` time; \"\n                            f\"its time cannot be read from the log\")\n```\n✓.\n\nNow the packer base:\n```\n    ev_names = set()\n    for c in pred.get(\"checks\") or []:\n        if c.get(\"evidence\"):\n            ev_names.add(c[\"evidence\"][\"name\"])\n    for e in pred.get(\"external\") or []:\n        if e.get(\"evidence\"):\n            ev_names.add(e[\"evidence\"][\"name\"])\n    for v in pred.get(\"violations\") or []:\n        r = (v.get(\"x-plumbline\") or {}).get(\"remedy\")\n        if r:\n            ev_names.add(r[\"evidence\"][\"name\"])\n    for n in sorted(ev_names):\n        add(f\"evidence/{n}\", ev_dir / n)\n```\n✓.\n\nNote the packer's `pred.get(\"external\")` — in build, external entries are `{\"requirement\", \"subject\", \"evidence\", \"readBy\"}`. ✓\n\nAlso note: the packer reads `ci` from `inputs/custody.json` for ev_dir. Fine.\n\nNow, in the packer, `xp` variable: base later has `xp = pred.get(\"x-plumbline\") or {}` further down? Let me check the base packer: \n```\n    ctx = [(ci.get(\"maker\") or {}).get(\"method_file\"), *((ci.get(\"instrument\") or {}).get(k) for k in (\"rubric_file\", \"runner_file\"))]\n    for k in ci.get(\"controls\") or []:\n        ctx += [k.get(\"case_file\"), k.get(\"evidence_file\")]\n    for e in ci.get(\"evaluators\") or []:\n        ctx