_inputs}:{n}\"\n```\n\nFor disposition:\n```python\n    live = ev_log.get(\"dispose\")\n    ...\n    if live:\n        xp[\"disposition_at_source\"] = \"logged live (inputs/custody-events.jsonl)\"\n        xp[\"sources\"][\"disposition.at\"] = f\"inputs/custody-events.jsonl:{live['_line']}\"\n    elif dsp.get(\"at\"):\n        n = line_in(inputs_path, dsp.get(\"at\"), \"at\")\n        if n:\n            xp[\"sources\"][\"disposition.at\"] = f\"{rel_inputs}:{n}\"\n    else:\n        xp[\"disposition_at_source\"] = \"emission time: no disposition time recorded (custody tools/make_record.py convention)\"\n```\n\nWait, base code:\n```python\n    if live and at and (live.get(\"at\") != at or live.get(\"by\") != dsp.get(\"by\")):\n        ref.add(...)\n    if live and not at:\n        at = live.get(\"at\")\n    if not at:\n        at = H.iso(now)\n        xp[\"disposition_at_source\"] = \"emission time: ...\"\n    elif live:\n        xp[\"disposition_at_source\"] = \"logged live (inputs/custody-events.jsonl)\"\n```\n\nI need to add the source. Let me restructure:\n```python\n    live = ev_log.get(\"dispose\")\n    if live and at and (live.get(\"at\") != at or live.get(\"by\") != dsp.get(\"by\")):\n        ref.add(...)\n    if live and not at:\n        at = live.get(\"at\")\n    if not at:\n        at = H.iso(now)\n        xp[\"disposition_at_source\"] = \"emission time: no disposition time recorded (custody tools/make_record.py convention)\"\n    elif live:\n        xp[\"disposition_at_source\"] = \"logged live (inputs/custody-events.jsonl)\"\n        xp[\"sources\"][\"disposition.at\"] = f\"inputs/custody-events.jsonl:{live['_line']}\"\n    else:\n        n = line_in(inputs_path, at, \"at\")\n        if n:\n            xp[\"sources\"][\"disposition.at\"] = f\"{rel_inputs}:{n}\"\n```\n\nHmm, if `live` and `at` (from dsp) equal, the `elif live` branch sets source. Good. If `live` and `at` differ, refusal anyway. If no live but `dsp[\"at\"]`, the `else` branch. If no `at` a